"tlh":{"tag":"“Einstein chauffeur story” luyajbogh ghotpu'vaD.<br class=\"br-mobile\"> (DaSovbe'chugh, yInej.)","s1":"motlh Duj HIjmeH toy'meH mIw Dalo'DI', tlhoy leS, voqlu'laHbe', pagh potlh 'angbe' 'e' DaHarlaH. ghu'vetlhvaD toy'meH mIwvam chenmoHlu'. poH lughDaq paw Ace; peghmey pol, 'ej wanI' potlhghach pab DujDaj, vangmeH mIwDaj je.","s2":"muD Duj verghvaD lengmey, je'wI'pu' pagh Huch nobwI'pu' qepmey, wanI'mey, nom Doch HIjmeH Qu'mey jevaD lI'laH. Duj, SeHwI' je wIvchu'lu' 'e' 'utDI', lI'. 'utDI', ghu' pabmeH mIwDaj choH Ace, vaj pawmeH mIw lugh 'ang. (Formal, Business Casual, Street Nice, pagh Comfy Casual.)","three":"toy'meH mIwvam Dalo'meH wej DuH tu'lu':","l1":"muvmeH QaH rurtaHvIS lo'laH {M} 'op muvpu'bogh ghotpu'.","l2":"taHbogh qeS pegh je'wI'pu'vaD, latlh toy'meH mIw rurtaHvIS chelmeH DuH qellaHlu'.","l3":"nIteb toy'meH mIwvam yIraQ; qav'ap DaDIl.","hs":"DIlmeH toy'meH mIw pat","min":"rav","pref":"maSlu'bogh","ext":"nI'","fmt":"mIw","best":"ghotpu'vamvaD lI'qu'","f1":"naDev, Lower MainlandDaq je lengmeH Qu'mey","b1":"naDev lengmey runvaD Ace, Duj je DapoQDI'. wej rep 'oH rav'e'; wej rep pagh poH nI' DaDIl.","f2":"poH nI' poQbogh Qu'mey, Hopbogh lengmey ghap","b2":"malja' DevwI'pu'vaD HIjmeH toy'meH mIw. leng SeH Ace; qeS nom, qeS yajchu'bogh je DapoQDI', SaH ghaH. jav rep 'oH rav'e'; jav rep pagh poH nI' DaDIl.","q":"leng nab qellu'DI' qav'ap noblu'","f3":"leng nI'qu'vaD toy'meH mIwmey","b3":"lengmey Hop, ramDaq taHbogh lengmey ghap; poH, QongmeH Daqmey, Soj je qelnISlu'.","n1":"rav poH retlhDaq latlh poH lo'lu'DI', $200/hour poQlu'.","n2":"{M} 'op muvpu'bogh ghotpu'vaD, Minimum, Preferred je DuHmey qav'ap 'oH $150/hr'e'.","p2":"(vummeH yInchaj taghpu'DI' Jim Rohn, Tony Robbins ghap, DuHIj 'ej jajlIj Delbogh mu'meylIj 'Ij, ghIq qeS pagh nItebHa' vangmeH HoS Dunob 'e' yIQub.)","ha":"poH lI' De'","a1":"latlh Qu'mey nabpu'bogh Ace qelnISlu'. vaj HIjmeH Qu'mey poH nabnISlu', leng taghpa' poH nI' ratlhtaHvIS.","a2":"leng nI' Da'uchDI', qaStaHvIS Ace Datlhejbogh leng, QongmeH Daqmey, Soj je lunab 'e' luchup Ace, ghomDaj je.","hb":"Qu' poH nabmeH mIw","k1":"puS poH lI' tu'lu'bogh, 'ej Hoch Qu' poH nab ghot. vaj 'InternetDaq Qu' poH wIvmeH 'ISjaH tu'lu'be'.","k2":"QummeH nav yIlo'. jajmey DamaSbogh, repmey DapIHbogh, DuHupmeH Daq, DuHIjmeH DoS Daq, wanI' latlh De' potlh je tIghItlh. poH lI' tu'lu' 'e' 'olmeH, qav'ap QIjlu'chu'bogh nobmeH je jang Ace boQwI'.","fine":"CAD lo' Hoch qav'apmey; GST ngaSbe'. Qu' poH nablu'DI', poH, Qu' qIlmeH mIw, ngaSbogh Dochmey je chutmey Delchu'lu'.","cta":"Ace Cybertruck Dalo'meH poH yInab"},
